IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPARQ-ULTRA-V6.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-ELEMENTS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SPARSITY-RATIO-PCT  PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 GAIN-MULT-X100      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPARQ-V6.
    IF TOTAL-ELEMENTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 56 TO SNR-DB.
    MOVE 380 TO GAIN-MULT-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-ELEMENTS.
    WEIGHT 30 GAIN-MULT-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
